+# Local replay resumption — 2026-11-21
+
+## Result and stop point
+
+The video-location blocker is resolved. All 20 uploaded clips are readable locally in `C:\Users\MY PC\Downloads\PhysiqueQuest testing`, and every byte size matches the prior upload inventory. No network fetch, package install, git-index modification or tracking-behavior change was made.
+
+The browser route still fails. The browser-free route successfully decoded and processed three REAL frames from `barbell bench press.mp4`, using ffmpeg, the app's local MediaPipe `.task` model, the CURRENT TypeScript registry/subject selector/counter and display filter.
+
+**Stop for labels/review.** No clip has reviewed full/partial rep counts in the new manifest. There is no labeled subset to score yet. A three-frame infrastructure probe is not a measured exercise-set baseline, and it cannot establish missed/double repetitions or a false-cue rate. No exercise is marked validated.
+
+## Verified local files
+
+`local-video-inventory.json` lists the full absolute path, byte size, SHA-256 and readability of every clip. All paths are under the folder above. Total size: **56,813,048 bytes**.
+
